{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dire circumstances see <strong>Boy</strong> escaping from home with shady figures on his tail. Find your way back while avoiding capture - through caves, mountains and mysterious facilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the road to a home where all might not be as it seems, all the while avoiding mishap and destruction, and the dangers of <i>gambling</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Homeshift</strong>\u00a0is a challenging 2D side scroller for experienced players and beginners alike. Expand your arsenal with items such as a Parachute, and carve ways through enemies with explosive consumables. Money is your best friend, while you experiment with various tools in your toolbox.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863240/extras/dbbd1177205d5bafbe7b8f321c624b5c.poster.avif?t=1759826201\" width=716 height=524 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863240/extras/dbbd1177205d5bafbe7b8f321c624b5c.webm?t=1759826201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863240/extras/dbbd1177205d5bafbe7b8f321c624b5c.mp4?t=1759826201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is a skill not many are well versed in, never mind <strong>Boy</strong>. Enemies present unique challenges, which might at times be better solved with precise jumps, rather than fighting back.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Modding</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Homeshift is built with modding support in mind. You can create new</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campaigns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art assets</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >utilising Open Source tools such as the <strong>Tiled</strong> level editor, with our provided plugins.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3863240?t=1759826201","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3863240?t=1759826201","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863240/7c7e1cea8e5d91f0aeccf306509452c7edad883c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759826201","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863240/7c7e1cea8e5d91f0aeccf306509452c7edad883c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759826201","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3957120,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dire circumstances see <strong>Boy</strong> escaping from home with shady figures on his tail. Find your way back while avoiding capture - through caves, mountains and mysterious facilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the road to a home where all might not be as it seems, all the while avoiding mishap and destruction, and the dangers of <i>gambling</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Homeshift</strong>\u00a0is a challenging 2D side scroller for experienced players and beginners alike. Expand your arsenal with items such as a Parachute, and carve ways through enemies with explosive consumables. Money is your best friend, while you experiment with various tools in your toolbox.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863240/extras/dbbd1177205d5bafbe7b8f321c624b5c.poster.avif?t=1759826201\" width=716 height=524 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863240/extras/dbbd1177205d5bafbe7b8f321c624b5c.webm?t=1759826201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863240/extras/dbbd1177205d5bafbe7b8f321c624b5c.mp4?t=1759826201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is a skill not many are well versed in, never mind <strong>Boy</strong>. Enemies present unique challenges, which might at times be better solved with precise jumps, rather than fighting back.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Modding</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Homeshift is built with modding support in mind. You can create new</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campaigns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art assets</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >utilising Open Source tools such as the <strong>Tiled</strong> level editor, with our provided plugins.</p>","developers":["Harjutales"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863240/d1ae29b77b34eddb0a3b4884bdd3afee93de0219/header.jpg?t=1759826201","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3863240/451835638/37c3e5774be660047384c5ed5978a65b55fa8cbf/1759773539/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759786212","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3863240/45183